@* Bracket required-field callout wrapper (BRKT-01).
   This partial renders only the outer .bracket-callout div and eyebrow label.
   The existing TargetCommanderBracket <label class="field"> block in DeckAnalysis.cshtml
   is placed inside this partial's wrapper via the calling view.
   Usage: wrap the bracket <label class="field"> inside @await Html.PartialAsync("_BracketCallout")

   NOTE: Because this partial wraps inline markup from the parent view, it cannot fully
   encapsulate the df-select content. Instead, the calling view (DeckAnalysis.cshtml)
   places the <div class="bracket-callout"> wrapper and <p class="bracket-callout__label">
   directly inline — this partial exists for documentation/discoverability only and is NOT
   called via PartialAsync. The actual bracket callout markup lives inline in DeckAnalysis.cshtml.
   See Plan 09-03 Task 1 for the inline wrapper implementation.
*@
<div class="bracket-callout">
    <p class="bracket-callout__label">Required before generating</p>
    @* Caller places the existing <label class="field"> for TargetCommanderBracket here *@
</div>
